    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-23T21:18:52+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-23T21:18:52+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-23T10:48:52Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-23T10:48:52Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough of low pressure that lies near the NT/WA border will combine with a trough and cold front further south to move over much of SA from Saturday, and over the far northeast on Sunday. A ridge of high pressure will then move into the west from late Sunday and persist over the rest of the state throughout next week.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW011" description="Eastern Eyre Peninsula" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-23T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-23T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. Slight chance of a shower near the coast, near zero chance elsewhere. Winds south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-24T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-23T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of rain, most likely in the late afternoon and evening. A thunderstorm likely, possibly severe with damaging winds and large hail. Winds south to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending north to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the middle of the day then tending southerly 20 to 30 km/h in the early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 15 with daytime temperatures reaching 26 to 32.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:20am to 4:40pm, UV Index predicted to reach 9 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-25T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-26T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-24T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-25T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of rain, most likely in the morning and early afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm near the coast in the early morning. Winds south to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h becoming light in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 12 with daytime temperatures reaching around 18.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-26T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-27T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-25T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-26T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Becoming cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the morning and afternoon. Light winds becoming westerly 15 to 20 km/h during the morning then turning southerly 15 to 25 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 5 and 8 with daytime temperatures reaching between 18 and 21.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-27T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-28T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-26T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-27T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning. Light winds becoming southerly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning then becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 6 and 10 with daytime temperatures reaching between 19 and 22.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
